+# Workspace Layout Design QA
+
+## Comparison Target
+
+- Source visual truth: `/Users/lensmiao/.codex/generated_images/019fd2a7-4cdc-77a1-be64-c5caae7a58ac/exec-666d0d9e-4ab9-46ff-b9b8-b02bc2e39c59.png`
+- Implementation screenshot: `/Users/lensmiao/Desktop/CCworks/Reversion反文/.tmp/workspace-layout-implementation.png`
+- Full-view comparison: `/Users/lensmiao/Desktop/CCworks/Reversion反文/.tmp/workspace-layout-comparison.png`
+- Focused top comparison: `/Users/lensmiao/Desktop/CCworks/Reversion反文/.tmp/workspace-layout-comparison-top.png`
+- Focused bottom comparison: `/Users/lensmiao/Desktop/CCworks/Reversion反文/.tmp/workspace-layout-comparison-bottom.png`
+- Viewport and CSS size: `1625 x 968`
+- Source pixels: `1625 x 968`
+- Implementation pixels: `1625 x 968`
+- Density normalization: source and implementation use the same pixel dimensions; the Electron capture viewport and output are both `1625 x 968`, so no resampling was applied.
+- State: macOS light interface, `zh-CN`, empty active `Untitled-1` document, table-of-contents sidebar selected, one visible tab, sidebar set to the source visual's 29.3% proportion.
+
+## Findings
+
+- No actionable P0, P1, or P2 differences remain.
+- The document title is centered on the editor pane, not the full window, and its vertical center matches the top workspace row.
+- The sidebar header and editor header terminate on the same horizontal divider within the 1 px E2E tolerance.
+- The sidebar toggle is present only at the sidebar header's upper-right edge. The top editor workspace no longer contains the toggle.
+- The tab strip is attached to the bottom edge of the editor pane. Its outer divider aligns with the sidebar footer, while the existing active-tab underline and new-tab behavior are preserved.
+- The table-of-contents heading uses a `29px` top margin, exactly 8 px above the prior `37px` position.
+
+## Required Fidelity Surfaces
+
+- Fonts and typography: the implementation keeps the product's existing UI fonts and sizes. `Untitled-1` retains the verified `600` weight; sidebar and tab typography retain the existing scale. The source mock is an ImageGen approximation, so no font substitution was introduced.
+- Spacing and layout rhythm: the shared `46px` workspace row, `78px` total header, `44px` bottom chrome, 20 px tab inset, and 8 px TOC heading lift reproduce the approved composition. Runtime geometry assertions passed for title centers and both horizontal dividers.
+- Colors and visual tokens: the implementation preserves the current Reversion theme variables. The source mock is warmer than the isolated E2E profile's light theme; this is an expected theme-state difference, not layout drift.
+- Image quality and asset fidelity: this screen has no raster content. No new image assets or icon substitutes were introduced; the existing sidebar-toggle and export icons were preserved.
+- Copy and content: `目录`, `Untitled-1`, `输入 / 插入段落`, and `中文 0 · 英文 0` are present in the normalized implementation state. The existing export chevron remains because it was outside the requested scope.
+
+## Interaction And Verification Evidence
+
+- Primary interactions tested: sidebar hide/restore; tab creation, switching, closing, overflow scrolling, focus, and dirty state.
+- Relevant Electron E2E: 17 passed.
+- Desktop unit suite: 69 files and 850 tests passed.
+- Typecheck: passed.
+- ESLint on changed TypeScript/Vue/test files: passed with no errors.
+- Production Electron build: passed.
+- Browser/renderer errors: no Playwright page failure or Electron renderer error surfaced during the layout capture and related E2E runs.
+
+## Comparison History
+
+1. The first implementation capture used the E2E profile's English locale and its initial sidebar width. These were capture-state mismatches, not product-code defects.
+2. The capture was normalized to `zh-CN`, one `Untitled-1` tab, `1625 x 968`, and the same sidebar proportion as the source visual.
+3. Full-view, top-region, and bottom-region comparisons found no actionable P0/P1/P2 differences. No post-comparison production-code fix was required.
+
+## Follow-up Polish
+
+- P3: the source mock includes native macOS traffic lights, while the Electron web-content screenshot omits native window chrome. The installed app supplies those controls outside the renderer capture.
+- P3: the generated mock's paper tint and exact TOC heading gap differ slightly from the real theme. The implementation intentionally preserves Reversion's existing theme and applies the user's explicit 8 px heading lift.
+
+## Implementation Checklist
+
+- [x] Move sidebar toggle to sidebar header.
+- [x] Move tabs to editor bottom.
+- [x] Align top horizontal dividers.
+- [x] Center title within the editor pane and top workspace row.
+- [x] Raise TOC heading by 8 px.
+- [x] Preserve tab and sidebar interactions.
+- [x] Pass visual and automated verification.
+
+final result: passed
