+# Vendored Typora theme transpiler
+
+`typora-import/` and `typora-map/` are **verbatim copies** of the same two
+directories under `scripts/` in the Reversion tooling repository
+(`mjlens-spec/Reversion`), which remains their upstream. They are vendored here
+so the app can transpile a Typora theme in-process, without shelling out to a
+Node script that is not part of the shipped bundle.
+
+Do not edit these files here. Change them in the tooling repo, then re-copy —
+a contract test there (`tests/typora-import-vendored.test.mjs`) byte-compares
+the two copies and fails the build if they drift.
+
+`index.mjs` exposes the whole pipeline as one pure function,
+`translateTyporaTheme(css, options)`, whose only runtime dependency is
+`postcss`. Everything file-system related lives in `../typoraThemeStore.ts`.
diff --git a/packages/desktop/src/main/typoraTheme/typora-import/css-ir.mjs b/packages/desktop/src/main/typoraTheme/typora-import/css-ir.mjs
